From 3be1d332a0d2551dbeb0a4b5664569e82cf7bba5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kirikaze Chiyuki <me@chyk.ink>
Date: Wed, 8 Apr 2026 08:03:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Input: touchscreen: add Himax HX83121A SPI driver

Add a complete touch-processing driver for Himax HX83121A touchscreens
connected over SPI, featuring:

- CMF (Common Mode Filter) for baseline noise suppression
- GridIIR temporal filtering for frame-to-frame smoothing
- 8-connected BFS macro-zone detection
- Palm rejection with area/signal/density heuristics
- Non-symmetric peak detection with multi-level filtering
- Weighted centroid calculation for sub-pixel positioning
- Velocity-based predictive multi-touch tracking

The driver uses the panel-follower API for automatic power management
and provides extensive runtime tunables via sysfs.

Upstream source: https://github.com/chiyuki0325/EGoTouchRev-Linux
Updated source: https://github.com/pgs666/EGoTouchRev-Linux/tree/windows-v1.1.2-port
Updated source revision: 75cb018

Signed-off-by: Kirikaze Chiyuki <me@chyk.ink>
Co-authored-by: Detach2233 <101026605+awarson2233@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-authored-by: wano <multicolor@sjtu.edu.cn>
Co-authored-by: Pengyu Luo <mitltlatltl@gmail.com>
